{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/c160659ff9b1986a4cb25ff413c47c30.poster.avif?t=1769611593\" width=882 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/c160659ff9b1986a4cb25ff413c47c30.webm?t=1769611593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/c160659ff9b1986a4cb25ff413c47c30.mp4?t=1769611593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Wildseed - This place used to be a thriving wildlife sanctuary, one of the most diverse in the world\u00a0- almost magical...\u00a0Then something happened years ago, scaring away all of the animals! But with some hard work I'm sure you'll be able to restore it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wildseed is a relaxing escape where you will plant, nurture, and watch your garden bloom! You start with a small patch of dirt, and grow it into a thriving and diverse home full of different habitats, plants and animals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/73732f3b3f234d730091caba4705b262.poster.avif?t=1769611593\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/73732f3b3f234d730091caba4705b262.webm?t=1769611593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/73732f3b3f234d730091caba4705b262.mp4?t=1769611593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivate and nurture a variety of plants, from carrots and watermelons to blueberry bushes and palm trees.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 75 cute animals to call your garden home, from mice and deer to whales and lions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find rare animal variants!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover what ancient mysteries of your garden holds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your encyclopedia with every animal found.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish meadows, forests, wetlands, kelp forests, coral reefs, rainforest, ocean, tundra habitats - and even more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish to fill your ponds and oceans.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/09b56a4247bc2fd019f4f2893d7ca12c.poster.avif?t=1769611593\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/09b56a4247bc2fd019f4f2893d7ca12c.webm?t=1769611593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/09b56a4247bc2fd019f4f2893d7ca12c.mp4?t=1769611593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job will be to keep your animals happy and your garden healthy. Find what food your creatures love! Keep your garden clear of weeds and your plants free from infestations as you\u00a0build your own cozy garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/6da9085b65f3890898ceb2118cd3dacd.poster.avif?t=1769611593\" width=598 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/6da9085b65f3890898ceb2118cd3dacd.webm?t=1769611593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/6da9085b65f3890898ceb2118cd3dacd.mp4?t=1769611593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3655270?t=1769611593","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/0bd48172322f1383bce85094caefa5cdbc5b7306/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769611593","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/4656a117d3f2c5d3910f990d5d67adf601e29511/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769611593","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/4656a117d3f2c5d3910f990d5d67adf601e29511/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769611593","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4171880,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/c160659ff9b1986a4cb25ff413c47c30.poster.avif?t=1769611593\" width=882 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/c160659ff9b1986a4cb25ff413c47c30.webm?t=1769611593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/c160659ff9b1986a4cb25ff413c47c30.mp4?t=1769611593\" type=\"video/mp4