 more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish to fill your ponds and oceans.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/09b56a4247bc2fd019f4f2893d7ca12c.poster.avif?t=1769611593\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/09b56a4247bc2fd019f4f2893d7ca12c.webm?t=1769611593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/09b56a4247bc2fd019f4f2893d7ca12c.mp4?t=1769611593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job will be to keep your animals happy and your garden healthy. Find what food your creatures love! Keep your garden clear of weeds and your plants free from infestations as you\u00a0build your own cozy garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/6da9085b65f3890898ceb2118cd3dacd.poster.avif?t=1769611593\" width=598 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/6da9085b65f3890898ceb2118cd3dacd.webm?t=1769611593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/6da9085b65f3890898ceb2118cd3dacd.mp4?t=1769611593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Moose Furious Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/76489de4fd6e34c2f0